[{"title":"示张唐臣诸人","author":"翠华仙伯","text":"玉皇香案晚朝回，小小星坛向夜开。\n一炷信香通鼻观，翠鸾飞背酒仙来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32551,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"示问行藏者","author":"翠华仙伯","text":"春来看取百花丛，粉白妖红造化功。\n燕子莺儿休调舌，花残明日起熏风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32552,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"享祭降笔","author":"赵静斋","text":"生居四代将门家，不幸遭逢被虏拿。\n死在瓜洲无葬地，幽魂夜夜到长沙。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32553,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"咏史","author":"独乐园主","text":"三皇之前不可传，尧舜垂衣化自然。\n夏衰商败兵革起，征讨有罪非传贤。\n苍姬种德极深厚，历载八百何绵绵。\n孔丘孟轲不得位，唯有文字登书编；春秋笔削严一字，诛恶褒善持大权；丘明作传详本末，下迨战国何茫然。\n秦皇并吞六王毕，始废封建迷井田；功高自谓传万世，仁义不施徒托仙；东游弗返祖龙死，赤灵火德明中天。\n汉朝文景称至治，刑措可比成康前；无端杂用黄老术，是以未得称其全。\n王莽贼臣篡汉祚，赖有光武如周宣；云台名将应列宿，婉婉良策扶戎轩；绝胜高祖醢彭越，可比周召终天年。\n崇儒往谒曲阜庙，典章灿灿罗星躔；后人不省创业苦，宠任阉宦皆貂蝉；西园粥爵诚可耻，党锢忠士灾何延。\n一朝曹氏帝称魏，铜驼荆棘生荒烟；关张早死后主弱，典午自帝开坤埏。\n五胡云扰乱中国，五马南渡何翩翩。\n六朝兴废有得失，岂知合并归杨坚；琼花城里建宫阙，汴河春水浮龙船。\n乱离思治否复泰，唐室高祖催飞骞；秦王神武不可及，遂承天祚传高玄。\n大纲不正有惭色，我尝抚卷思其渊。\n纷纷女祸握神器，扰扰藩镇横戈鋋；乘舆避乱数奔窜，翠华几度游西川。\n黄巢残贼不忍说，白骨山积血成泉；侵凌渐使唐祚绝，江海虽大犹涓涓。\n朱温降将乃一贼，僭号暂时得复失。\n后唐石晋暨知远，但以功利不尚德。\n周家亦僭登天基，独有世宗明治术。\n我朝列圣皆深仁，天下苍生得苏息。\n史书浩浩充屋栋，人主欲观宁遍及。\n小臣纂集作通鉴，治乱兴亡明似日。\n愿言乙夜细垂观，比美成王戒无逸。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32554,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"求仙诗","author":"密兰沙","text":"刀笔相从四十年，非非是是万千千。\n一家富贵千家怨，半世功名百世愆。\n牙笏紫袍今已矣，芒鞋竹杖任悠然。\n有人问我蓬莱事，云在青山水在天。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32555,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"示陈友定","author":"忠烈祠神","text":"将军何事访山家，火冷炉温谩煮茶。\n若问圣明吾岂敢，止能疗病与驱邪。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32556,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题蕉叶诗二首 其一","author":"羽客","text":"午夜君山玩月回，西邻小圃碧莲开。\n天风香雾苍华冷，名籍因由问汝来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32557,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题蕉叶诗二首 其二","author":"羽客","text":"白雪红铅立圣胎，美金花要十分开。\n好同子往瀛洲看，云在青霄鹤未来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32558,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"诗","author":"悬葫芦仙诗","text":"葫芦一个是生涯，閒步人间访酒家。\n要问狂夫何处住，蓬山洞口有桃花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32559,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"聚景园","author":"卫芳华鬼","text":"湖上园亭好，重来忆旧游。\n徵歌调玉树，阅舞按梁州。\n径狭花迎辇，池深柳拂舟。\n昔人皆已没，谁与话风流？","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32560,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"口占","author":"郑婉娥鬼","text":"凤舰龙舟事已空，银屏金屋梦魂中。\n黄芦晚日空残垒，碧草寒烟锁故宫。\n隧道鱼灯油欲烬，妆台鸾镜匣长封。\n凭君莫话兴亡事，泪湿胭脂损旧容。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32561,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"全生诗","author":"华亭二生","text":"几年兵火接天涯，白骨丛中度岁华。\n杜宇有冤能泣血，邓攸无子可传家。\n当时自诧辽东豕，今日翻成井底蛙。\n一片春光谁是主？\n野花开满蒺藜沙。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32562,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"贾生诗","author":"华亭二生","text":"漠漠荒郊鸟乱飞，人民城郭叹都非。\n河沈朽骨何须葬，血污游魂不得归。\n麦饭无人作寒食，绨袍有泪笑斜晖。\n生存零落皆如此，但恨平生壮志违。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32563,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"仙方诗","author":"无名氏","text":"纷纷墓土黄金屑，片片花飞白玉芝。\n君主一斤臣四两，调和服下即平夷。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32564,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"晚翠亭诗","author":"无名氏","text":"一径入青松，飞流澹晴绿。\n道人晚归来，长歌振林谷。\n山深不知秋，落叶下枯木。\n须臾翠烟开，月色照綵服。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32565,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"荆州鬼语","author":"无名氏","text":"苦也苦，几时泥到襄阳府。\n苦也苦，几时泥到成都府。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32566,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"示周允和","author":"大涤洞天仙人","text":"苍然耸空碧，指点人不识。\n我来契宿缘，镌记云根石。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32567,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"梦中贯酸斋彭郎词","author":"酸斋仙客","text":"番之湖兮云水杳，万顷晴波净如埽。\n相逢渔子问二姑，大姑不如小姑好。\n小姑昨夜妆束巧，新月半痕玉梳小。\n彭郎欲娶无良媒，飞向庐山寻五老。\n五老颓然不肯起，彭郎怒踢香炉倒。\n彭郎彭郎归去来，陶令门前烟树晓。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32568,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"元初童谣","author":"无名氏","text":"塔儿红，北人来作主人翁；塔儿白，南人是主北为客。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32569,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"元谶","author":"无名氏","text":"大元之后有庚申。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32570,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"法服歌诀","author":"无名氏","text":"袜履中单黄带先，裙袍蔽膝绶绅连。\n方心曲领蓝腰带，玉佩丁当冠笏全。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32571,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"滨州民歌","author":"无名氏","text":"田野桑麻一倍增，昔无粗麻今纩缯，太守之德如景星。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32572,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"马氏铁券谶","author":"无名氏","text":"至元十五六，狗儿坏我屋。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32573,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"信州路谶","author":"无名氏","text":"水打巷村园，永丰出状元。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32574,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"嘲洪起畏","author":"无名氏","text":"家在临安，职守京口。\n北骑若来，不降则走。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32575,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"皇舅墓谣","author":"无名氏","text":"皇舅墓门闭，运粮向北去；水渰墓门开，运粮却回来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32576,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"井字谜","author":"无名氏","text":"四十零八个头，一头还对一脚。\n中间全无肚肠，外面许多棱角。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32577,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"用字谜","author":"无名氏","text":"三山自三山，山山甘倒悬。\n一月复一月，月月还相连。\n左右排双羽，纵横列二川。\n阖家都六口，两口不团圆。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32578,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"大明寺水隐语","author":"无名氏","text":"一人堂堂，两曜垂光。\n井深尺一，点去冰旁。\n二人同行，不欠一边。\n三梁四柱足火然，若有双钩日月全。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32579,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"颂程雪楼","author":"无名氏","text":"闽中有雪方为贵，天下无楼如此高。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32580,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"无名状","author":"无名氏","text":"老书生，小书生，二书生坏了中书省。\n不言不语张左丞，铺眉扇眼董参政，也待学魏徵一般俸请。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32581,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"宁都州民歌","author":"无名氏","text":"去年雪，今年雨。\n微计侯，那得此。\n民既悦，天应喜。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32582,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"宣城民哭邑令","author":"无名氏","text":"公来何其迟，公去何其速。\n使我宣城民，何以遂生育？","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32583,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"雷州民歌","author":"无名氏","text":"潟卤为田兮，孙父之教。\n渠之泱泱兮，长我粳稻。\n自今有年兮，无旱无涝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32584,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"浮梁民谣","author":"无名氏","text":"桃李阴阴六万家，下居民不识官衙。\n甘棠喜有千年政，美玉终无一点瑕。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32585,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"太仓谣","author":"无名氏","text":"打碗花子开，今搬州县来。\n黄郎屋上走，州县住不久。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32586,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"至治间占","author":"无名氏","text":"天狗坠地为赤犬，其下有大军覆境。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32587,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"李好文谚","author":"无名氏","text":"目耕夜分李好文。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32588,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"绍兴乡人语","author":"无名氏","text":"欲学孝妇，当学俞母。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32589,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"斛铭","author":"无名氏","text":"出以是，入以是。\n是子孙，永如是。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32590,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"浙西谚","author":"无名氏","text":"年年防火起，夜夜防贼来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32591,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"无锡谶","author":"无名氏","text":"无锡平，天下宁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32592,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"三险谚","author":"无名氏","text":"馩香吸髓倚阑干。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32593,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"巴豆黄连谚","author":"无名氏","text":"巴豆未开花，黄连先结子。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32594,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"金银珠谣","author":"无名氏","text":"活银病金死珠子。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32595,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"明宗时童谣","author":"无名氏","text":"牡丹红，禾苗空。\n牡丹紫，禾苗死。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32596,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"十七字诗","author":"无名氏","text":"自谓非其子，如今作天子。\n传语老蛮子，请死。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32597,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"元统间谣","author":"无名氏","text":"天雨氂，事不齐。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32598,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"菩萨线谣","author":"无名氏","text":"天雨线，民起怨。\n中原地，事必变。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32599,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"京师童谣","author":"无名氏","text":"白雁望南飞，马札望北跳。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32600,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"京师语","author":"无名氏","text":"上把君欺，下把民虐，太皇太后倚恃著。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32601,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"书省壁","author":"无名氏","text":"人皆谓我不办事，天下办事有几人？\n袖里屠龙斩蛟手，埋没青锋二十春。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32602,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"至正中谚","author":"无名氏","text":"李如黄瓜，民皆无家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32603,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"江西福建怨谣","author":"无名氏","text":"九重丹诏颁恩至，万两黄金奉使回。\n奉使来时，惊天动地；奉使去时，乌天黑地。\n官吏都欢天喜地，百姓却啼天哭地。\n官吏黑漆皮灯笼，奉使来时添一重。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32604,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"石人谣","author":"无名氏","text":"莫道石人一只眼，此物一出天下反。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32605,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"平江郡石上谶","author":"无名氏","text":"三十八，十八子，寅卯年，至辰巳。\n合收张翼，同为列国。\n不在常，不在祥，切须款款细思量。\n旦卜水，暮愁米，浮图倒地莫扶起。\n修石岸，重开河，军民拍手笑呵呵。\n日出屋东头，鲤鱼上山游。\n星从月里过，会在午年头。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32606,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"嘲三宝奴","author":"无名氏","text":"茶盐酒醋都提举，僧道医工总相公。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32607,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"粘国门诗","author":"无名氏","text":"虾蟆水上浮，雪雪见日消，定住不开口。\n汪家奴，只一朝，国事休矣。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32608,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上海县谣","author":"无名氏","text":"鸡啼不拍翅，鸦鸟不转更。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32609,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"至正中大理童谣","author":"无名氏","text":"莫道君为山海主，山海笑咳咳。\n园中花谢千万朵，别有明主来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32610,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"至正中燕京童谣三首","author":"无名氏","text":"牵郎郎，拽弟弟，打破碗儿便作地。\n阴凉阴凉过河去，日头日头过山来。\n脚驴斑斑，脚躐南山。\n南山北斗，养活家狗，家狗磨面，三十弓箭。\n上马琵琶，下马琵琶，驴蹄马蹄，缩了一只。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32611,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"台温处树旗谣","author":"无名氏","text":"天高皇帝远，民少相公多。\n一日三遍打，不反待如何？","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32612,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"方国珍谣","author":"无名氏","text":"杨氏青，出贼精。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32613,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"京师童谣","author":"无名氏","text":"一阵黄风一阵沙，千里万里无人家。\n回头雪消不堪看，三眼和尚弄瞎马。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32614,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"松江谣","author":"无名氏","text":"满城都是火，府官四散躲。\n城里无一人，红军府上坐。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32615,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"张士信杨完者谣","author":"无名氏","text":"死不怨，泰州张；生不谢，宝庆杨。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32616,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"闽清民歌","author":"无名氏","text":"彼寇来雠兮，得吾侯而蒙休。\n彼寇远遁兮，吾侯锡我室家之无忧。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32617,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"武冈民颂","author":"无名氏","text":"前有公绰，武冈父母；今之郡侯，毋乃其后。\n足我衣食，安我田亩。\n我子我孙，与侯同久。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32618,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"曲沃民歌","author":"无名氏","text":"泮宫之崇，以扶儒宗。\n社稷之封，以祈年丰。\n肇之者谁？\n令尹之功。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32619,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"福宁州谣三首 其一","author":"无名氏","text":"吾侬生长莆山曲，三尺茅檐四尺屋。\n大男终岁食无盐，老妇蒸藜泪盈掬。\n阿郎辛苦学弄兵，年年贩盐南海滨。\n担头有盐兵一束，群行大队惊四邻。\n迩来红巾掠州县，沃野平民不知战。\n贤哉太守死作灰，勇矣林僧命如线。\n林僧一战功业单，策马东走来莆山。\n山人踯躅喜相遇，邀我邻社东南旋。\n我邻我社轻死士，苦竹长枪兼丈五。\n自从行劫出社来，社甲吹螺整行伍。\n时维癸巳夏五月，暍暑微民正愁绝。\n螺声隐隐入郭门，白旆央央下林樾。\n饥儿寡妇常咨咨，老弱奔走趋道隅。\n鹙鸧翻羽动天哭，虎豹掉尾何时需。\n空城一炬灰烬后，车盖归来仍白授。\n阿娘垢面迎相公，西邻椎牛唤新酒。\n酒酣拍掌浩浩歌，天地虽大如吾何！\n女儿朝餐餍粱肉，走卒出市陈干戈。\n市人累累丧家狗，路上相逢尽缠首。\n儒巾惊骇迎先锋，小儿号哭畏郎吼。\n老翁再拜乞见怜，自从乱后无一钱。\n舍人官买鸡豕尽，有田未种蚕未眠。\n先锋拔刀倍嗔怒，缚得家翁出门去。\n妻儿哭泣投社官，愿获生全拜君赐。\n社官点头见始欢，年来钱钞交莫悭。\n尔田傥入莆社籍，尔屋老稚从居安。\n我田我庐不足惜，应当门户谁出入。\n生男愿作社中吏，生女愿作先锋妾。\n胡然太府亶不聪，有书辄上莆社公。\n柏台主人任刀笔，札札按覆皆相同。\n向来壤地方万里，比屋豪华皆武士。\n五侯同封不足誇，一家十轮未为易。\n匹夫势转千乘强，驱役百姓如驱羊。\n编民贡税入私室，小大驱合无边方。\n手提文印绿衣者，饥食无鱼出无马。\n流离安集无定期，蓬蒿猎猎故城下。\n道旁遗老问行人，泰安有社民未贫。\n行人蹙额皆相语，我闻公社吏更仁。\n前年泰安挹城邑，未曾入城先报捷。\n前师失利后师奔，一市横尸更稠叠。\n至今大厦环州营，一门公相皆弟兄。\n豺狼盘踞食人肉，一叱一咤风云生。\n我闻有命不敢告，俯首未言胆先破。\n老翁闻此双泪垂，风雨洗天何人到。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32620,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"福宁州谣三首 其二","author":"无名氏","text":"袁君袁君诚儿嬉，东山之下筑城池。\n掘人冢石叠墙堑，占民田土开营基。\n欲谋于此胚汉业，井蛙尊大情何痴。\n役民荷锸任犁穴，无骸不露堪欷歔。\n前人尽辞长夜室，天阴露冷凉啾悲。\n山中独存袁氏墓，若堂之封何巍巍。\n又见若坊若夏屋，芙蓉筑城芳飞飞。\n无归之鬼欲托处，游目一见动所思。\n鬼灵相率语其下，主人肃入安便宜。\n众鬼夜深苦啼哭，主人慰勉甘其辞。\n惟桑与梓焉有旧，颠危自合相扶持。\n儿孙祭扫同尔享，佳城爽垲同尔归。\n且叙平生受苦语，又奚深夜啼悲为。\n众鬼致词恤久远，天地循环何所期。\n城池恐为他人得，他人又嫌墙堑卑。\n发号令民更增筑，吾家已破墙无基。\n恐人掘石及君墓，嗟余与君俱无依。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32621,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]